{"slug":"Universal-Script-Speed-Gui-Universal-46768","_id":"6888ff87c8c2b1ab28d7fb1c","title":"Speed Gui Universal","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"A clean and simple GUI script that allows you to fully control your character's WalkSpeed in-game.\nIncludes buttons to increase or decrease speed, toggle speed on/off, and minimize or close the GUI with ease.\n\nFeatures:\n\nReal-time WalkSpeed control\n\nSleek and responsive UI\n\nEasy to use (+ / - buttons)\n\nToggle to reset back to normal speed (16)\n\nFully customizable\n\n\nNote:\nPerfect for games that allow WalkSpeed modification.\nAll UI elements are animated for a smooth experience.\n\nScript by AB0OD\nOriginally by XONE (Fly GUI)\n\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\nسكربت GUI بسيط واحترافي للتحكم بسرعة حركة اللاعب (WalkSpeed) داخل اللعبة.\nيحتوي على واجهة سهلة الاستخدام تشمل أزرار للتحكم في السرعة (+ و -)، مع زر تفعيل/تعطيل السرعة، بالإضافة إلى زر طي الواجهة أو إغلاقها بالكامل.\n\nالميزات:\n\nتعديل WalkSpeed بسرعة.\n\nتصميم واجهة أنيق وسلس.\n\nتحكم كامل بالسرعة لحظيًا.\n\nمناسب لجميع الألعاب التي تسمح بتعديل WalkSpeed.\n\n\nملاحظة:\nالسرعة تعود للوضع الطبيعي (16) عند إيقاف التفعيل.\nقابل للتعديل حسب الرغبة.\n\nالسكربت بواسطة AB0OD \nفي الأصل بواسطة XONE (Fly GUI)","tags":["Universal","Speed"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TIG0Z/mRXScripts/refs/heads/main/speed-1.txt\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6611d5d98ef522f25c47b7e2","username":"AB0OD","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9f8f5535968c44f432c33425bbc4c7d31f0c01091231d8506ef2eb4f08983e1e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6611d5d98ef522f25c47b7e2-1753782210760.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6611d5d98ef522f25c47b7e2","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","